<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n112374" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φροντ-λστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for thinking, thoughtful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Div.Somn.</u>
				464a23
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπίνων δὲ πάνυ φ.</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίγνεται</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				271
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. τὴν πρόσοψιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Pisc.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ λογιστικὸν καὶ φ.</span> the
			faculty <i>of</i> reasoning and <i>thought,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.432c
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				966a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>considerate, careful,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ θήλεα περὶ τὴν τῶν τέκνων τροφὴν
					φροντιστικώτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					608b2
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.11.10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				8.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>nervous, worried,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				10.538
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
